- [Nette libraries |upgrading-nette], what the package `dresscode/upgrade-nette` covers in all versions.
- [Upgrading to a newer PHP |upgrading-php], because Nette 3.1 needs at least PHP 7.2, while Nette 2.4 runs even on PHP 5.6.
- [Upgrade Your Code Step by Step |upgrade], `upgrade today`, the estimate and the plan in detail.

